	(text "R2301 (47 kOhm) and R2302 (10 kOhm) attenuate the positive rail. R2303 (10\nkOhm) limits ADC-node source current; C2301 (100 nF) filters PROG_V_P15.\nIncluding the divider resistance, tau is about 1.82 ms. This path monitors\nthe rail level and averages short programming pulses."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 90.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "22308b80-8904-4893-ae2a-d6efc2dc0427")
	)
	(text "SHEET GUIDE / 2300_PROGRAM_INTERFACE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 19.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 86 96 108 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "23268f19-0c0f-4f18-9754-4b0fba9b0a91")
	)
	(text "Positive rail monitor"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23 43 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2491872b-ccec-450e-9b1d-16ff65dcb567")
	)
	(text "The divider measures voltage; it does not set the programming rails.\nV(PROG_V_P15) = V(PROG_P15) x R2302 / (R2301 + R2302) = V(PROG_P15) / 5.7. A\n15 V positive output gives about 2.632 V. Update the ADC conversion scale if\neither divider value changes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 116 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "27f09fa4-bd34-419c-99cd-4546e5cb3ccd")
	)
	(text "Output and protection"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 136.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.9 1.9)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2fe7d575-74e5-4016-a997-385bd1702654")
	)
	(text "Programming rail output"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 95 43 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "344bfea0-e5dd-4768-ad9b-fdd04a5295d4")
	)
	(text "Input and enable"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 60.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.9 1.9)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "399b60cb-010f-4dac-a532-e648dc9e77b6")
	)
	(text "BAT54S: 1 = GND, 2 = AON, 3 = ADC node.\nKeep AON valid while the programming rail is present."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23 102 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3f9d7aa8-b4e0-4727-b185-87a351b4a3b6")
	)
	(text "15 V -> 2.632 V at PROG_V_P15\nRail-level check; tau about 1.82 ms."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 23 49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4c652494-4485-4fd2-bd2d-15451408884a")
	)
	(text "D2301 (BAT54S) clamps PROG_V_P15 toward GND and AON: pin 1 = GND, pin 2 =\nAON, pin 3 = monitor node. The upper clamp can inject current into AON during\nfaults or power-off. Rail switching and power protection remain upstream;\nthis sheet measures only the positive output."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 141 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "641220ef-17f7-474d-8e1a-893f4c81c9ee")
	)
	(text "1: PROG_P15   2: GND   3: PROG_N15\nSwitched rails arrive from upstream."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 94 70 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6f2deb8a-256f-49ae-89a8-c169af326c20")
	)
	(text "Programming rail interface and monitor"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 26.24 0)
